//
//  Release.xcconfig
//  desktop
//

// Configuration settings file format documentation can be found at:
// https://help.apple.com/xcode/#/dev745c5c974

// The configuration carries the profile -- optimization, assertions, debug information -- and
// nothing about how the build is distributed. A build driven by bw-task passes the identity,
// provisioning profile and entitlements for its distribution channel on the command line,
// which outranks everything here. These are what a Release build gets when it is built from
// Xcode instead, where there is no channel to ask.
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Developer ID Application
PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER = Bitwarden Desktop Autofill Extension Developer Dis
